 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250828/68af8038bb822.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250828/68af8038bb822.jpg"> </div><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-14/69b4379462a7dnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">阿根廷跟队：阿根廷拒绝去西班牙踢欧美杯，建议选择欧洲其他地方</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-14/69b475c7e5e7bnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">记者：阿根廷足协考虑欧美杯改成两回合制，伯纳乌+纪念碑球场</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-14/69b47ddcd01d4native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">阿媒：斯卡洛尼已经准备好欧美杯初选名单，但是担忧比赛无法进行</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-14/69b486d4ea869native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">阿根廷跟队：欧足联和南美足联同意明天再对欧美杯做出决定</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.48" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_220602/6297d8a15addd.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.48" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.48" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_220602/6297d8a15addd.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_220602/6297d8a15addd.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">据阿根廷跟队记者Gastón Edul报道称，阿根廷和南美足联拒绝去西班牙踢欧美杯，要么去欧洲其他城市要么比赛搁置。与此同时，各大媒体都带来了有关这场比赛的最新消息。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-13/69b4254d5da58native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">英媒：德科提出巴萨续租拉什福德一年 曼联索要3000万欧买断费</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260110/696204a6d2541.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260110/696204a6d2541.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260110/696204a6d2541.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">据talkSPORT报道，拉什福德今夏继续留在巴萨的交易已接近达成协议，但巴萨和曼联之间仍需完成部分谈判工作。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-14/69b46c8605c79native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">罗马诺：那不勒斯已正式敲定4400万欧买断霍伊伦！转会总价5000万</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.79" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260314/202603140359426042.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.79" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.79" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260314/202603140359426042_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260314/202603140359426042_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">名记罗马诺在个人社媒报道称，那不勒斯已经确认将从曼联买断霍伊伦。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-13/69b427a3aedb4native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">充电2小时...30岁门迪刚复出2场又受伤，赛季至今仅为皇马出战5次</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_240924/66f296c966a3c.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_240924/66f296c966a3c.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_240924/66f296c966a3c.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">皇马今日宣布左后卫门迪右腿股二头肌肌肉拉伤，门迪本赛季已遭遇了4次伤病，大多都为肌肉问题。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-13/69b427694ced8native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">跑起来！皇马本赛季欧冠首次跑动超过对手，皮塔奇、82超11公里</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.46" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260313/202603132315071645.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.46" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.46" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260313/202603132315071645_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260313/202603132315071645_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">欧冠1/8决赛首回合，皇马主场3-0完胜曼城。西班牙媒体《马卡报》撰文，分析了皇马在本场比赛中展现出的跑动能力。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-13/69b42a6cbbb38native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">塔帅：我认为巴萨的球全欧最好看，但他们踢纽卡的表现我从未见过</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.78" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260313/202603132318457680.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.78" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.78" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260313/202603132318457680_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260313/202603132318457680_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">阿森纳主帅阿尔特塔今天出席英超赛前发布会，谈到了本周欧冠纽卡主场1-1战平巴萨的比赛。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-13/69b425fbda44fnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">ESPN：埃梅里被曼联球迷视为主帅升级人选，但与曼联管理层不兼容</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.38" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260222/6999df1d7cf84.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.38" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.38" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.